The copy is removed from the loop. One stylesheet:

```css
@supports (anchor-name: --dsh-webchat-anchor) {
  .dsh-wc-host {
    anchor-name: --dsh-webchat-anchor;
  }

The browser resolves those four values on every layout. The overlay follows the
panel through fullscreen, windowed, sidebar and resize changes with no
listeners, no timers, no `ResizeObserver` and no JavaScript after mount.
